      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks like it might be incorrect.  We should have a string with the first ID value in \u0027id_attr\u0027.  You are trying to check for a multi-valued LDAP attribute, so I think you would want to check how many items are in here instead:\n\n  search_result[0][1][self.id_attr]",
